.TH GIF-TOOLS 1
.SH NAME
bit2gif, gif2bit, metamorph \- GIF/Inferno-bitmap conversion tools
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B bit2gif
.I file.bit
.br
.B gif2bit
.I file.gif
.br
.B metamorph
.I nslides
.SH DESCRIPTION
.TP
.B bit2gif
Converts an Inferno bitmap image to a GIF file of the same base name.
.TP
.B gif2bit
Converts a GIF image to an Inferno bitmap file of the same base name.
.TP
.B metamorph
Converts a numbered sequence of GIF slides
.RI ( img001.GIF ", " img002.GIF ", ..., up to " nslides )
in the current directory into Inferno bitmap files
.RI ( img1.bit ", " img2.bit ", ...), one call handling a whole slide "
deck rather than one file at a time.
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/cmd/bit2gif.b
.br
.B /appl/cmd/gif2bit.b
.br
.B /appl/cmd/metamorph.b
